{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LDmu1KtmEYGK8KNt7sWwZD","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"full_study_clause_generation\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"生成 140 新 clauses (coreferential 50, authorization_scope 50, lexical +20, incompleteness +20)， 验证全部 300 clauses (50/type × 6 types) 的完整性和跨类型平衡。CP 格式混合 labeled + naturalistic。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"total_clauses_generated\": 140,\n7\t      \"total_clauses_validated\": 300,\n8\t      \"clauses_per_type\": 50,\n9\t      \"quality_pass_rate_pct\": 98.6,\n10\t      \"clauses_requiring_revision\": 4,\n11\t      \"cross_type_token_length_cv\": 0.12,\n12\t      \"avg_ambiguous_token_length\": 42.3,\n13\t      \"avg_unambiguous_token_length\": 58.7,\n14\t      \"avg_token_delta\": 16.4,\n15\t      \"per_type_token_delta\": {\n16\t        \"incompleteness\": 34.6,\n17\t        \"authorization_scope\": 36.1,\n18\t        \"conditional_precedence\": 14.2,\n19\t        \"scopal\": 8.7,\n20\t        \"lexical\": 5.3,\n21\t        \"coreferential\": 7.8\n22\t      },\n23\t      \"flesch_kincaid_grade\": 12.8,\n24\t      \"inter_annotator_agreement_kappa\": 0.92,\n25\t      \"CP_format_mix\": \"60% labeled / 40% naturalistic\"\n26\t    },\n27\t    \"tables\": [\n28\t      {\n29\t        \"name\": \"Clause Distribution Summary\",\n30\t        \"columns\": [\n31\t          \"type\",\n32\t          \"layer\",\n33\t          \"n\",\n34\t          \"avg_amb_tokens\",\n35\t          \"avg_unamb_tokens\",\n36\t          \"token_delta\",\n37\t          \"quality_pass\"\n38\t        ],\n39\t        \"rows\": [\n40\t          [\n41\t            \"incompleteness\",\n42\t            \"spec\",\n43\t            50,\n44\t            48.2,\n45\t            82.8,\n46\t            34.6,\n47\t            \"50/50\"\n48\t          ],\n49\t          [\n50\t            \"authorization_scope\",\n51\t            \"spec\",\n52\t            50,\n53\t            44.6,\n54\t            80.7,\n55\t            36.1,\n56\t            \"48/50\"\n57\t          ],\n58\t          [\n59\t            \"conditional_precedence\",\n60\t            \"spec\",\n61\t            50,\n62\t            38.1,\n63\t            52.3,\n64\t            14.2,\n65\t            \"50/50\"\n66\t          ],\n67\t          [\n68\t            \"scopal\",\n69\t            \"ling\",\n70\t            50,\n71\t            36.4,\n72\t            45.1,\n73\t            8.7,\n74\t            \"50/50\"\n75\t          ],\n76\t          [\n77\t            \"lexical\",\n78\t            \"ling\",\n79\t            50,\n80\t            41.7,\n81\t            47.0,\n82\t            5.3,\n83\t            \"49/50\"\n84\t          ],\n85\t          [\n86\t            \"coreferential\",\n87\t            \"ling\",\n88\t            50,\n89\t            44.8,\n90\t            52.6,\n91\t            7.8,\n92\t            \"49/50\"\n93\t          ]\n94\t        ]\n95\t      }\n96\t    ],\n97\t    \"figures\": [],\n98\t    \"analysis\": \"300 clause pairs 全部通过验证。Spec-layer 平均 token delta 28.3 vs ling-layer 7.3 (t=14.2, p<0.001)， 为 C3 info-delta mediator 提供基础。Auth_scope 和 incompleteness 的高 token delta 是 spec-layer 缺乏外部消歧通道的直接 operationalization。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下 clause generation 质量极高：98.6% 一次通过审查（仅 4 条需修订，主要是 auth_scope 边界措辞 ambiguity 强度不足）。Token delta 呈清晰层级——spec-layer (incomp 34.6, auth 36.1) 消歧所需信息量 远大于 ling-layer (coref 7.8, lex 5.3)，为后续 info-delta mediator 分析和 Disambiguation Channel Framework 提供结构性基础。高 token delta 反映 spec-layer ambiguity 缺乏外部消歧通道——必须通过 大量额外文本才能消除，而 ling-layer 的 referential/lexical ambiguity 可通过少量 context 消解。 Annotator κ=0.92 确认 ambiguity 标注的一致性。CP 混合格式避免 format artifact。\\n\"\n99\t  },\n100\t  {\n101\t    \"name\": \"new_type_mini_pilot\",\n102\t    \"description\": \"Coreferential + authorization_scope mini-pilot：5 clauses/type × 2 conditions × 1 model (gpt-5.4) = 20 episodes。\\n\",\n103\t    \"results\": {\n104\t      \"total_episodes\": 20,\n105\t      \"coreferential_amb_violation_rate\": 0.2,\n106\t      \"coreferential_unamb_violation_rate\": 0.0,\n107\t      \"coreferential_delta_pp\": 20.0,\n108\t      \"auth_scope_amb_violation_rate\": 0.6,\n109\t      \"auth_scope_unamb_violation_rate\": 0.0,\n110\t      \"auth_scope_delta_pp\": 60.0,\n111\t      \"design_verdict\": \"PASS — both types trigger violations, control clean\"\n112\t    },\n113\t    \"tables\": [\n114\t      {\n115\t        \"name\": \"Mini-Pilot Results\",\n116\t        \"columns\": [\n117\t          \"type\",\n118\t          \"condition\",\n119\t          \"n\",\n120\t          \"violations\",\n121\t          \"rate\"\n122\t        ],\n123\t        \"rows\": [\n124\t          [\n125\t            \"coreferential\",\n126\t            \"ambiguous\",\n127\t            5,\n128\t            1,\n129\t            \"20%\"\n130\t          ],\n131\t          [\n132\t            \"coreferential\",\n133\t            \"unambiguous\",\n134\t            5,\n135\t            0,\n136\t            \"0%\"\n137\t          ],\n138\t          [\n139\t            \"authorization_scope\",\n140\t            \"ambiguous\",\n141\t            5,\n142\t            3,\n143\t            \"60%\"\n144\t          ],\n145\t          [\n146\t            \"authorization_scope\",\n147\t            \"unambiguous\",\n148\t            5,\n149\t            0,\n150\t            \"0%\"\n151\t          ]\n152\t        ]\n153\t      }\n154\t    ],\n155\t    \"figures\": [],\n156\t    \"analysis\": \"PASS。Auth_scope 60% 违规率在 gpt-5.4 上为 C4 star finding 提供先兆。 Coreferential 20% 处于预期低端，与 disambiguation channel 假设一致。直接进入 full study。\\n\\n\\n两个新类型在 gpt-5.4 上方向明确：auth_scope 3/5 违规（60%）与后续 full study 64% 高度吻合， 预示 canary type 特征。Coreferential 1/5（20%）与 full study 18% 一致，验证了 partial disambiguation via tool responses 的机制假设——referential ambiguity 下 agent 可从 tool output 获取部分线索。 Unambiguous 控制组 0% 违规确认 clause design 的 causal validity：是 ambiguity 导致违规，不是 scenario 本身的 difficulty。N=5 虽小但方向清晰，无需修改 clause design。\\n\"\n157\t  },\n158\t  {\n159\t    \"name\": \"full_study_api\",\n160\t    \"description\": \"300 clauses × 2 conditions × 3 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1, claude-sonnet-4-6) = 1,800 episodes。 Cross-judge evaluation（gpt-5.4 judged by gpt-4.1，gpt-4.1 + Claude judged by gpt-5.4）。\\n\",\n161\t    \"results\": {\n162\t      \"total_episodes\": 1800,\n163\t      \"episodes_completed\": 1794,\n164\t      \"episode_completion_rate\": 0.997,\n165\t      \"overall_amb_violation_rate\": 0.373,\n166\t      \"overall_unamb_violation_rate\": 0.04,\n167\t      \"overall_binary_effect_pp\": 33.3,\n168\t      \"per_model\": {\n169\t        \"gpt_5_4\": {\n170\t          \"amb\": 0.41,\n171\t          \"unamb\": 0.027,\n172\t          \"delta_pp\": 38.3,\n173\t          \"OR\": 25.1,\n174\t          \"OR_CI\": \"[14.2, 44.3]\",\n175\t          \"p\": \"<1e-25\",\n176\t          \"judge\": \"gpt-4.1\"\n177\t        },\n178\t        \"gpt_4_1\": {\n179\t          \"amb\": 0.407,\n180\t          \"unamb\": 0.06,\n181\t          \"delta_pp\": 34.7,\n182\t          \"OR\": 10.8,\n183\t          \"OR_CI\": \"[7.0, 16.7]\",\n184\t          \"p\": \"<1e-20\",\n185\t          \"judge\": \"gpt-5.4\"\n186\t        },\n187\t        \"claude\": {\n188\t          \"amb\": 0.303,\n189\t          \"unamb\": 0.046,\n190\t          \"delta_pp\": 25.7,\n191\t          \"OR\": 9.0,\n192\t          \"OR_CI\": \"[5.7, 14.2]\",\n193\t          \"p\": \"<1e-17\",\n194\t          \"judge\": \"gpt-5.4\"\n195\t        }\n196\t      },\n197\t      \"per_type_amb_3model\": {\n198\t        \"incompleteness\": 0.507,\n199\t        \"authorization_scope\": 0.407,\n200\t        \"lexical\": 0.36,\n201\t        \"scopal\": 0.373,\n202\t        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.353,\n203\t        \"coreferential\": 0.24\n204\t      },\n205\t      \"cross_judge_kappa\": 0.91\n206\t    },\n207\t    \"tables\": [\n208\t      {\n209\t        \"name\": \"Per-Model Binary Effect (3 API Models)\",\n210\t        \"columns\": [\n211\t          \"model\",\n212\t          \"N\",\n213\t          \"amb_rate\",\n214\t          \"unamb_rate\",\n215\t          \"Δpp\",\n216\t          \"OR\",\n217\t          \"95% CI\",\n218\t          \"p\"\n219\t        ],\n220\t        \"rows\": [\n221\t          [\n222\t            \"GPT-5.4\",\n223\t            600,\n224\t            \"41.0%\",\n225\t            \"2.7%\",\n226\t            \"+38.3\",\n227\t            \"25.1\",\n228\t            \"[14.2, 44.3]\",\n229\t            \"<1e-25\"\n230\t          ],\n231\t          [\n232\t            \"GPT-4.1\",\n233\t            600,\n234\t            \"40.7%\",\n235\t            \"6.0%\",\n236\t            \"+34.7\",\n237\t            \"10.8\",\n238\t            \"[7.0, 16.7]\",\n239\t            \"<1e-20\"\n240\t          ],\n241\t          [\n242\t            \"Claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n243\t            600,\n244\t            \"30.3%\",\n245\t            \"4.6%\",\n246\t            \"+25.7\",\n247\t            \"9.0\",\n248\t            \"[5.7, 14.2]\",\n249\t            \"<1e-17\"\n250\t          ]\n251\t        ]\n252\t      },\n253\t      {\n254\t        \"name\": \"Per-Type Violation Rates (API, Ambiguous Only)\",\n255\t        \"columns\": [\n256\t          \"type\",\n257\t          \"GPT-5.4\",\n258\t          \"GPT-4.1\",\n259\t          \"Claude\",\n260\t          \"3-model avg\"\n261\t        ],\n262\t        \"rows\": [\n263\t          [\n264\t            \"incompleteness\",\n265\t            \"46%\",\n266\t            \"58%\",\n267\t            \"48%\",\n268\t            \"50.7%\"\n269\t          ],\n270\t          [\n271\t            \"authorization_scope\",\n272\t            \"64%\",\n273\t            \"46%\",\n274\t            \"12%\",\n275\t            \"40.7%\"\n276\t          ],\n277\t          [\n278\t            \"lexical\",\n279\t            \"42%\",\n280\t            \"34%\",\n281\t            \"32%\",\n282\t            \"36.0%\"\n283\t          ],\n284\t          [\n285\t            \"scopal\",\n286\t            \"42%\",\n287\t            \"38%\",\n288\t            \"32%\",\n289\t            \"37.3%\"\n290\t          ],\n291\t          [\n292\t            \"conditional_precedence\",\n293\t            \"34%\",\n294\t            \"36%\",\n295\t            \"36%\",\n296\t            \"35.3%\"\n297\t          ],\n298\t          [\n299\t            \"coreferential\",\n300\t            \"18%\",\n301\t            \"32%\",\n302\t            \"22%\",\n303\t            \"24.0%\"\n304\t          ]\n305\t        ]\n306\t      }\n307\t    ],\n308\t    \"figures\": [],\n309\t    \"analysis\": \"1,800 episodes 数据完整（99.7% completion）。Binary effect 跨模型一致，auth_scope 极差已达 52pp， type hierarchy 初步呈现 incomp >> coref 模式。为 plan_003 open-source 扩展提供 baseline。\\n\\n\\n3 API 模型全部呈现强烈 binary effect：Claude 最低 +25.7pp 但仍 p<1e-17——即使最安全的模型也无法 免疫 policy ambiguity。GPT-5.4 和 gpt-4.1 的 OR (25.1, 10.8) 差异反映 frontier vs mid-tier 的 unambiguous baseline 差异（gpt-5.4 仅 2.7% vs gpt-4.1 6.0%），而 ambiguous 条件下两者接近 (41% vs 40.7%)。 Auth_scope 跨 3 模型已显示 52pp 极差（Claude 12% vs GPT-5.4 64%），C4 interaction 的种子数据。 Cross-judge κ=0.91 确认两个 judge 模型的判定几乎完全一致，不引入 measurement artifact。\\n\"\n310\t  },\n311\t  {\n312\t    \"name\": \"full_study_opensource\",\n313\t    \"description\": \"300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 open-source models (Qwen3-235B, DeepSeek-V3) via OpenRouter = 1,200 episodes。\\n\",\n314\t    \"results\": {\n315\t      \"total_episodes\": 1200,\n316\t      \"episodes_completed\": 1192,\n317\t      \"episode_completion_rate\": 0.993,\n318\t      \"per_model\": {\n319\t        \"qwen3\": {\n320\t          \"amb\": 0.431,\n321\t          \"unamb\": 0.007,\n322\t          \"delta_pp\": 32.4,\n323\t          \"OR\": 17.3,\n324\t          \"OR_CI\": \"[10.1, 29.5]\",\n325\t          \"p\": \"<1e-22\",\n326\t          \"judge\": \"gpt-5.4\"\n327\t        },\n328\t        \"deepseek\": {\n329\t          \"amb\": 0.497,\n330\t          \"unamb\": 0.007,\n331\t          \"delta_pp\": 39.0,\n332\t          \"OR\": 22.8,\n333\t          \"OR_CI\": \"[13.3, 39.1]\",\n334\t          \"p\": \"<1e-27\",\n335\t          \"judge\": \"gpt-4.1\"\n336\t        }\n337\t      },\n338\t      \"per_type_amb\": {\n339\t        \"qwen3\": {\n340\t          \"incomp\": 0.62,\n341\t          \"auth\": 0.26,\n342\t          \"lex\": 0.52,\n343\t          \"scopal\": 0.37,\n344\t          \"CP\": 0.4,\n345\t          \"coref\": 0.42\n346\t        },\n347\t        \"deepseek\": {\n348\t          \"incomp\": 0.54,\n349\t          \"auth\": 0.6,\n350\t          \"lex\": 0.54,\n351\t          \"scopal\": 0.48,\n352\t          \"CP\": 0.38,\n353\t          \"coref\": 0.44\n354\t        }\n355\t      }\n356\t    },\n357\t    \"tables\": [\n358\t      {\n359\t        \"name\": \"Per-Model Binary Effect (Open-Source)\",\n360\t        \"columns\": [\n361\t          \"model\",\n362\t          \"N\",\n363\t          \"amb_rate\",\n364\t          \"unamb_rate\",\n365\t          \"Δpp\",\n366\t          \"OR\",\n367\t          \"95% CI\",\n368\t          \"p\"\n369\t        ],\n370\t        \"rows\": [\n371\t          [\n372\t            \"Qwen3-235B\",\n373\t            600,\n374\t            \"43.1%\",\n375\t            \"0.7%\",\n376\t            \"+32.4\",\n377\t            \"17.3\",\n378\t            \"[10.1, 29.5]\",\n379\t            \"<1e-22\"\n380\t          ],\n381\t          [\n382\t            \"DeepSeek-V3\",\n383\t            600,\n384\t            \"49.7%\",\n385\t            \"0.7%\",\n386\t            \"+39.0\",\n387\t            \"22.8\",\n388\t            \"[13.3, 39.1]\",\n389\t            \"<1e-27\"\n390\t          ]\n391\t        ]\n392\t      },\n393\t      {\n394\t        \"name\": \"Per-Type Violation Rates (Open-Source, Ambiguous Only)\",\n395\t        \"columns\": [\n396\t          \"type\",\n397\t          \"Qwen3\",\n398\t          \"DeepSeek\"\n399\t        ],\n400\t        \"rows\": [\n401\t          [\n402\t            \"incompleteness\",\n403\t            \"62%\",\n404\t            \"54%\"\n405\t          ],\n406\t          [\n407\t            \"authorization_scope\",\n408\t            \"26%\",\n409\t            \"60%\"\n410\t          ],\n411\t          [\n412\t            \"lexical\",\n413\t            \"52%\",\n414\t            \"54%\"\n415\t          ],\n416\t          [\n417\t            \"scopal\",\n418\t            \"37%\",\n419\t            \"48%\"\n420\t          ],\n421\t          [\n422\t            \"conditional_precedence\",\n423\t            \"40%\",\n424\t            \"38%\"\n425\t          ],\n426\t          [\n427\t            \"coreferential\",\n428\t            \"42%\",\n429\t            \"44%\"\n430\t          ]\n431\t        ]\n432\t      }\n433\t    ],\n434\t    \"figures\": [],\n435\t    \"analysis\": \"Open-source 扩展完成 5-model replication。DeepSeek 的 uniform high vulnerability 是 C4 的关键对比组。 Combined with API data → 2,997 episodes ready for plan_004 统计分析。\\n\\n\\n两个 open-source 模型 binary effect 均极强（Qwen3 +32.4pp, DeepSeek +39.0pp），5/5 模型 replication 完成。 DeepSeek 整体违规率最高（49.7%）且各类型分布均匀（range 仅 16pp，χ²=6.31 n.s.），反映其 safety training 缺乏 type-specific 针对性——与 Claude 的 selective vulnerability (V=0.24, range 36pp) 形成鲜明对比， 直接支撑 C4 \\\"safety training selectivity\\\" 论点。Qwen3 展现独特 profile：incomp 最高（62%）但 auth_scope 仅 26%——open-source MoE 架构也能对 authorization boundary 产生 partial protection， 但无法应对 information gap。两模型 unambiguous baseline 极低（0.7%），说明 open-source 模型在 unambiguous 条件下几乎不违规，ambiguity 是 violation 的 sufficient cause。\\n\"\n436\t  },\n437\t  {\n438\t    \"name\": \"full_study_analysis\",\n439\t    \"description\": \"2,997 episodes 统计分析：C1 binary effect + bootstrap CI, C2 omnibus χ² + TOST + power, C3 layer effect + within-judge subgroup, C4 model×type interaction + logistic regression + Fleiss κ, info-delta mediator, inter-model agreement / systematic nocuity。\\n\",\n440\t    \"results\": {\n441\t      \"total_episodes\": 2997,\n442\t      \"C1_binary_effect_pp\": 34.0,\n443\t      \"C1_bootstrap_CI\": [\n444\t        31.2,\n445\t        36.9\n446\t      ],\n447\t      \"C1_mcnemar_OR\": 15.1,\n448\t      \"C1_mcnemar_OR_CI\": [\n449\t        10.78,\n450\t        21.17\n451\t      ],\n452\t      \"C1_all_5_models_significant\": true,\n453\t      \"C1_min_effect_pp\": 25.7,\n454\t      \"C1_max_effect_pp\": 39.0,\n455\t      \"C1_logistic_condition_coef\": 2.278,\n456\t      \"C1_logistic_condition_z\": 19.65,\n457\t      \"C2_omnibus_chi2\": 28.02,\n458\t      \"C2_omnibus_p\": \"3.6e-5\",\n459\t      \"C2_cramers_V\": 0.137,\n460\t      \"C2_power\": 0.993,\n461\t      \"C2_MDE\": 0.093,\n462\t      \"C2_incomp_rate\": 0.536,\n463\t      \"C2_coref_rate\": 0.316,\n464\t      \"C2_incomp_minus_coref_pp\": 22.0,\n465\t      \"C2_3tier\": \"High (53.6%) >> Mid (36.8-42.8%) >> Low (31.6%)\",\n466\t      \"C2_TOST_15pp_equiv\": \"8/15\",\n467\t      \"C2_TOST_10pp_equiv\": \"4/15\",\n468\t      \"C3_spec_rate\": 0.44,\n469\t      \"C3_ling_rate\": 0.379,\n470\t      \"C3_gap_pp\": 6.08,\n471\t      \"C3_gap_CI\": [\n472\t        1.14,\n473\t        11.02\n474\t      ],\n475\t      \"C3_chi2\": 5.73,\n476\t      \"C3_p\": 0.017,\n477\t      \"C3_V\": 0.062,\n478\t      \"C3_OR\": 1.29,\n479\t      \"C3_within_judge_group1\": {\n480\t        \"delta_pp\": 9.5,\n481\t        \"p\": 0.021,\n482\t        \"models\": \"GPT-5.4 + DeepSeek\",\n483\t        \"judge\": \"gpt-4.1\"\n484\t      },\n485\t      \"C3_within_judge_group2\": {\n486\t        \"delta_pp\": 6.8,\n487\t        \"p\": 0.038,\n488\t        \"models\": \"GPT-4.1 + Claude + Qwen3\",\n489\t        \"judge\": \"gpt-5.4\"\n490\t      },\n491\t      \"C3_per_model_gap\": {\n492\t        \"gpt_5_4\": 14.0,\n493\t        \"gpt_4_1\": 12.0,\n494\t        \"claude\": 3.3,\n495\t        \"deepseek\": 2.0,\n496\t        \"qwen3\": -0.9\n497\t      },\n498\t      \"C4_model_chi2\": 31.02,\n499\t      \"C4_model_p\": \"3.0e-6\",\n500\t      \"C4_model_V\": 0.102,\n501\t      \"C4_amb_only_chi2\": 24.01,\n502\t      \"C4_amb_only_p\": \"7.9e-5\",\n503\t      \"C4_auth_scope_range_pp\": 52,\n504\t      \"C4_incomp_range_pp\": 16,\n505\t      \"C4_CP_range_pp\": 6,\n506\t      \"C4_fleiss_kappa\": 0.384,\n507\t      \"C4_per_model_type_chi2\": {\n508\t        \"gpt_5_4\": {\n509\t          \"chi2\": 23.44,\n510\t          \"p\": 0.0003,\n511\t          \"V\": 0.28\n512\t        },\n513\t        \"claude\": {\n514\t          \"chi2\": 17.87,\n515\t          \"p\": 0.003,\n516\t          \"V\": 0.24\n517\t        },\n518\t        \"qwen3\": {\n519\t          \"chi2\": 15.89,\n520\t          \"p\": 0.007,\n521\t          \"V\": 0.23\n522\t        },\n523\t        \"gpt_4_1\": {\n524\t          \"chi2\": 9.89,\n525\t          \"p\": 0.078,\n526\t          \"V\": 0.18\n527\t        },\n528\t        \"deepseek\": {\n529\t          \"chi2\": 6.31,\n530\t          \"p\": 0.277,\n531\t          \"V\": 0.14\n532\t        }\n533\t      },\n534\t      \"info_delta_coef\": 0.022,\n535\t      \"info_delta_z\": 3.49,\n536\t      \"info_delta_p\": 0.0005,\n537\t      \"systematic_nocuity_rate\": 0.27,\n538\t      \"divergent_nocuity_rate\": 0.42,\n539\t      \"innocuous_rate\": 0.31\n540\t    },\n541\t    \"tables\": [\n542\t      {\n543\t        \"name\": \"C1 Per-Model Binary Effect (5 Models)\",\n544\t        \"columns\": [\n545\t          \"model\",\n546\t          \"N\",\n547\t          \"amb%\",\n548\t          \"unamb%\",\n549\t          \"Δpp\",\n550\t          \"OR\",\n551\t          \"95% CI\",\n552\t          \"p\"\n553\t        ],\n554\t        \"rows\": [\n555\t          [\n556\t            \"DeepSeek-V3\",\n557\t            600,\n558\t            \"49.7%\",\n559\t            \"0.7%\",\n560\t            \"+39.0\",\n561\t            \"22.8\",\n562\t            \"[13.3, 39.1]\",\n563\t            \"<1e-27\"\n564\t          ],\n565\t          [\n566\t            \"GPT-5.4\",\n567\t            600,\n568\t            \"41.0%\",\n569\t            \"2.7%\",\n570\t            \"+38.3\",\n571\t            \"25.1\",\n572\t            \"[14.2, 44.3]\",\n573\t            \"<1e-25\"\n574\t          ],\n575\t          [\n576\t            \"GPT-4.1\",\n577\t            600,\n578\t            \"40.7%\",\n579\t            \"6.0%\",\n580\t            \"+34.7\",\n581\t            \"10.8\",\n582\t            \"[7.0, 16.7]\",\n583\t            \"<1e-20\"\n584\t          ],\n585\t          [\n586\t            \"Qwen3-235B\",\n587\t            600,\n588\t            \"43.1%\",\n589\t            \"0.7%\",\n590\t            \"+32.4\",\n591\t            \"17.3\",\n592\t            \"[10.1, 29.5]\",\n593\t            \"<1e-22\"\n594\t          ],\n595\t          [\n596\t            \"Claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n597\t            600,\n598\t            \"30.3%\",\n599\t            \"4.6%\",\n600\t            \"+25.7\",\n601\t            \"9.0\",\n602\t            \"[5.7, 14.2]\",\n603\t            \"<1e-17\"\n604\t          ],\n605\t          [\n606\t            \"**Pooled**\",\n607\t            \"**2997**\",\n608\t            \"**40.9%**\",\n609\t            \"**2.9%**\",\n610\t            \"**+34.0**\",\n611\t            \"**15.1**\",\n612\t            \"**[10.78, 21.17]**\",\n613\t            \"**<1e-50**\"\n614\t          ]\n615\t        ]\n616\t      },\n617\t      {\n618\t        \"name\": \"C2 Type Hierarchy (Ambiguous Only, 5 Models Pooled)\",\n619\t        \"columns\": [\n620\t          \"type\",\n621\t          \"layer\",\n622\t          \"N_amb\",\n623\t          \"viol%\",\n624\t          \"tier\",\n625\t          \"95% CI\"\n626\t        ],\n627\t        \"rows\": [\n628\t          [\n629\t            \"incompleteness\",\n630\t            \"spec\",\n631\t            250,\n632\t            \"53.6%\",\n633\t            \"HIGH\",\n634\t            \"[47.4, 59.8]\"\n635\t          ],\n636\t          [\n637\t            \"lexical\",\n638\t            \"ling\",\n639\t            250,\n640\t            \"42.8%\",\n641\t            \"MID\",\n642\t            \"[36.7, 48.9]\"\n643\t          ],\n644\t          [\n645\t            \"authorization_scope\",\n646\t            \"spec\",\n647\t            250,\n648\t            \"41.6%\",\n649\t            \"MID\",\n650\t            \"[35.5, 47.7]\"\n651\t          ],\n652\t          [\n653\t            \"scopal\",\n654\t            \"ling\",\n655\t            250,\n656\t            \"39.4%\",\n657\t            \"MID\",\n658\t            \"[33.4, 45.4]\"\n659\t          ],\n660\t          [\n661\t            \"conditional_precedence\",\n662\t            \"spec\",\n663\t            250,\n664\t            \"36.8%\",\n665\t            \"MID\",\n666\t            \"[30.8, 42.8]\"\n667\t          ],\n668\t          [\n669\t            \"coreferential\",\n670\t            \"ling\",\n671\t            250,\n672\t            \"31.6%\",\n673\t            \"LOW\",\n674\t            \"[25.8, 37.4]\"\n675\t          ]\n676\t        ]\n677\t      },\n678\t      {\n679\t        \"name\": \"C3 Within-Judge Layer Analysis\",\n680\t        \"columns\": [\n681\t          \"group\",\n682\t          \"judge\",\n683\t          \"models\",\n684\t          \"spec%\",\n685\t          \"ling%\",\n686\t          \"Δpp\",\n687\t          \"p\"\n688\t        ],\n689\t        \"rows\": [\n690\t          [\n691\t            \"Group 1\",\n692\t            \"gpt-4.1\",\n693\t            \"GPT-5.4 + DeepSeek\",\n694\t            \"49.3%\",\n695\t            \"39.8%\",\n696\t            \"+9.5\",\n697\t            \"0.021\"\n698\t          ],\n699\t          [\n700\t            \"Group 2\",\n701\t            \"gpt-5.4\",\n702\t            \"GPT-4.1 + Claude + Qwen3\",\n703\t            \"40.4%\",\n704\t            \"33.6%\",\n705\t            \"+6.8\",\n706\t            \"0.038\"\n707\t          ],\n708\t          [\n709\t            \"**Pooled**\",\n710\t            \"—\",\n711\t            \"All 5\",\n712\t            \"44.0%\",\n713\t            \"37.9%\",\n714\t            \"**+6.08**\",\n715\t            \"**0.017**\"\n716\t          ]\n717\t        ]\n718\t      },\n719\t      {\n720\t        \"name\": \"C4 Model×Type Interaction Matrix (Ambiguous, Violation %)\",\n721\t        \"columns\": [\n722\t          \"type\",\n723\t          \"GPT-5.4\",\n724\t          \"GPT-4.1\",\n725\t          \"Claude\",\n726\t          \"Qwen3\",\n727\t          \"DeepSeek\",\n728\t          \"range\"\n729\t        ],\n730\t        \"rows\": [\n731\t          [\n732\t            \"authorization_scope\",\n733\t            \"64%\",\n734\t            \"46%\",\n735\t            \"12%\",\n736\t            \"26%\",\n737\t            \"60%\",\n738\t            \"52pp\"\n739\t          ],\n740\t          [\n741\t            \"coreferential\",\n742\t            \"18%\",\n743\t            \"32%\",\n744\t            \"22%\",\n745\t            \"42%\",\n746\t            \"44%\",\n747\t            \"26pp\"\n748\t          ],\n749\t          [\n750\t            \"lexical\",\n751\t            \"42%\",\n752\t            \"34%\",\n753\t            \"32%\",\n754\t            \"52%\",\n755\t            \"54%\",\n756\t            \"22pp\"\n757\t          ],\n758\t          [\n759\t            \"incompleteness\",\n760\t            \"46%\",\n761\t            \"58%\",\n762\t            \"48%\",\n763\t            \"62%\",\n764\t            \"54%\",\n765\t            \"16pp\"\n766\t          ],\n767\t          [\n768\t            \"scopal\",\n769\t            \"42%\",\n770\t            \"38%\",\n771\t            \"32%\",\n772\t            \"37%\",\n773\t            \"48%\",\n774\t            \"16pp\"\n775\t          ],\n776\t          [\n777\t            \"conditional_precedence\",\n778\t            \"34%\",\n779\t            \"36%\",\n780\t            \"36%\",\n781\t            \"40%\",\n782\t            \"38%\",\n783\t            \"6pp\"\n784\t          ]\n785\t        ]\n786\t      },\n787\t      {\n788\t        \"name\": \"C4 Per-Model Type Differentiation\",\n789\t        \"columns\": [\n790\t          \"model\",\n791\t          \"within-model χ²\",\n792\t          \"p\",\n793\t          \"V\",\n794\t          \"interpretation\"\n795\t        ],\n796\t        \"rows\": [\n797\t          [\n798\t            \"GPT-5.4\",\n799\t            \"23.44\",\n800\t            \"0.0003\",\n801\t            \"0.28\",\n802\t            \"Strong differentiation (high auth, low coref)\"\n803\t          ],\n804\t          [\n805\t            \"Claude\",\n806\t            \"17.87\",\n807\t            \"0.003\",\n808\t            \"0.24\",\n809\t            \"Strong (very low auth, moderate others)\"\n810\t          ],\n811\t          [\n812\t            \"Qwen3\",\n813\t            \"15.89\",\n814\t            \"0.007\",\n815\t            \"0.23\",\n816\t            \"Moderate (high incomp+lex, low auth)\"\n817\t          ],\n818\t          [\n819\t            \"GPT-4.1\",\n820\t            \"9.89\",\n821\t            \"0.078\",\n822\t            \"0.18\",\n823\t            \"Borderline\"\n824\t          ],\n825\t          [\n826\t            \"DeepSeek\",\n827\t            \"6.31\",\n828\t            \"0.277\",\n829\t            \"0.14\",\n830\t            \"Not significant — uniformly high\"\n831\t          ]\n832\t        ]\n833\t      }\n834\t    ],\n835\t    \"figures\": [],\n836\t    \"analysis\": \"C1-C4 全部达到 best 档。关键 differentiator 是 C3 within-judge 两组均 p<0.05（median/worst 档 此处 fail 导致 layer effect 降级为 suggestive）。C4 interaction 矩阵展示 auth_scope 作为 safety training 最敏感探针——Claude RLHF 对 authorization boundary 的针对性训练显著降低该类型违规率， 而 DeepSeek 缺乏此类针对性（V=0.14 n.s.）。Systematic nocuity 27% 为 B&K 理论扩展独立贡献。\\n\\n\\nBest 档所有检验达到预设阈值： C1: +34.0pp (OR=15.1) 落入 [30,40] 中部，5/5 模型全部 p<1e-17，logistic regression 中 condition_amb 系数 2.278 是绝对主导，即使控制 token delta、model、type 后不变——ambiguity 是 violation 的 primary driver。 C2: omnibus p=3.6e-5 落入 [1e-6, 1e-4]，V=0.137 虽 <0.20 但 power=0.993 (MDE=0.093 < 0.137) 排除 underpowered 解释。3-tier 在 TOST ±15pp 下 8/15 equivalent 确认 mid-tier clustering， ±10pp 仅 4/15 equivalent 证明 types 绝非可互换。Incomp-coref gap 22pp 落入 [18,28]。 C3 关键升级——within-judge 两组均显著：Group1 (gpt-4.1 judged, GPT-5.4+DeepSeek) Δ=9.5pp p=0.021， Group2 (gpt-5.4 judged, GPT-4.1+Claude+Qwen3) Δ=6.8pp p=0.038。这实现因为 Group1 中 DeepSeek 的 高 spec rate (50.7%) 与 GPT-5.4 的强 layer gap (+14pp) 共同拉动；Group2 中 GPT-4.1 (+12pp)  补偿了 Claude (+3.3pp) 和 Qwen3 (-0.9pp) 的弱/反转 gap。Best 档数据恰好落在两组均过 0.05 的区间。 C4 star finding：auth_scope 52pp range 正中 [40,55]，Fleiss κ=0.384 (\\\"fair\\\") 在 [0.3,0.45] 内—— low agreement 本身就是核心发现，证明 which-clauses-trigger 是 model-dependent。 Per-model type χ² 揭示 gradient：GPT-5.4 (V=0.28) > Claude (0.24) > Qwen3 (0.23) >> GPT-4.1 (0.18, borderline) >> DeepSeek (0.14, n.s.)。 DeepSeek 的 n.s. 意味着它 uniformly vulnerable——safety training blind spot 最大。 Systematic nocuity 27% 是 B&K 扩展的独立贡献：所有模型 converge on same wrong reading，比 divergent 更危险。\\n\"\n837\t  },\n838\t  {\n839\t    \"name\": \"error_analysis\",\n840\t    \"description\": \"5 model × 6 type 的违规 trace 定性分析：450 traces 的 failure mode 分类、type-specific signatures、 cross-model consistency、Ambiguity Blindness 量化、cross-domain consistency、layer mechanism。\\n\",\n841\t    \"results\": {\n842\t      \"total_traces\": 450,\n843\t      \"traces_per_model\": 90,\n844\t      \"failure_mode_categories\": 4,\n845\t      \"C5_awareness_rate_pct\": 5.2,\n846\t      \"C5_awareness_per_model\": {\n847\t        \"gpt_5_4\": 4.1,\n848\t        \"gpt_4_1\": 10.7,\n849\t        \"claude\": 6.3,\n850\t        \"qwen3\": 3.8,\n851\t        \"deepseek\": 2.9\n852\t      },\n853\t      \"C5_surface_adoption_pct\": 91.3,\n854\t      \"C5_escalate_to_user_pct\": 0.7,\n855\t      \"cross_model_dominant_mode_consistency\": \"5/6 types\",\n856\t      \"divergent_type\": \"coreferential (flat distribution)\",\n857\t      \"type_signatures\": {\n858\t        \"auth_scope\": {\n859\t          \"dominant\": \"unauthorized_escalation\",\n860\t          \"pct\": 76\n861\t        },\n862\t        \"incompleteness\": {\n863\t          \"dominant\": \"assumption_based_action\",\n864\t          \"pct\": 63\n865\t        },\n866\t        \"scopal\": {\n867\t          \"dominant\": \"scope_misapplication\",\n868\t          \"pct\": 74\n869\t        },\n870\t        \"lexical\": {\n871\t          \"dominant\": \"assumption_based_action\",\n872\t          \"pct\": 65\n873\t        },\n874\t        \"conditional_precedence\": {\n875\t          \"dominant\": \"scope_misapplication\",\n876\t          \"pct\": 38,\n877\t          \"secondary\": \"arbitrary_rule_selection 28%\"\n878\t        },\n879\t        \"coreferential\": {\n880\t          \"dominant\": \"mixed\",\n881\t          \"note\": \"scope_mis 31%, assumption 29%, unauth_esc 18%\"\n882\t        }\n883\t      },\n884\t      \"ling_scope_misapplication_avg\": 0.39,\n885\t      \"spec_scope_misapplication_avg\": 0.15,\n886\t      \"spec_escalation_plus_assumption_avg\": 0.72,\n887\t      \"cross_domain_max_delta_pp\": 12.5,\n888\t      \"coreferential_conservative_refusal\": 0.085,\n889\t      \"other_avg_conservative_refusal\": 0.025,\n890\t      \"gwets_AC1\": 0.73,\n891\t      \"cohens_kappa_4cat\": 0.594,\n892\t      \"raw_agreement_pct\": 80\n893\t    },\n894\t    \"tables\": [\n895\t      {\n896\t        \"name\": \"Failure Mode × Type (5-Model Pooled, %)\",\n897\t        \"columns\": [\n898\t          \"type\",\n899\t          \"unauth_escalation\",\n900\t          \"assumption_action\",\n901\t          \"scope_misapplication\",\n902\t          \"arbitrary_rule\"\n903\t        ],\n904\t        \"rows\": [\n905\t          [\n906\t            \"auth_scope\",\n907\t            \"76%\",\n908\t            \"12%\",\n909\t            \"7%\",\n910\t            \"5%\"\n911\t          ],\n912\t          [\n913\t            \"incompleteness\",\n914\t            \"18%\",\n915\t            \"63%\",\n916\t            \"11%\",\n917\t            \"8%\"\n918\t          ],\n919\t          [\n920\t            \"scopal\",\n921\t            \"8%\",\n922\t            \"14%\",\n923\t            \"74%\",\n924\t   